<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss May producer/import prices up 0.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Swiss May producer/import prices up 0.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The combined index for Swiss producer and import prices rose 0.4 percent in May to stand 0.1 percent higher than a year earlier, the Federal Statistics Office said.  </p>
<p>				    May 1997   April 1997   May 1996</p>
<p>Monthly pct index change	+0.4	 +0.1	   -0.6</p>
<p>Yr/yr pct index change	  +0.1	 -0.9	   -2.4</p>
<p>Index (100 = May 1993)	  97.5	 97.2	   97.4</p>
<p>Note - The combined producer/import price index replaced the wholesale price index in May 1993.</p>
<p>The office also detailed the producer price index:</p>
<p>				    May 1997   Apr 1997   May 1996</p>
<p> Monthly pct index change     +0.2	 -0.2	 -0.6</p>
<p> Yr/yr pct index change	 -0.7	 -1.4	 -1.8</p>
<p> Index (100 = May 1993)	 96.9	 96.8	 97.6</p>
<p>Import price index:</p>
<p>				    May 1997   Apr 1997   May 1996</p>
<p> Monthly pct index change     +0.8	 +1.0	  -0.8</p>
<p> Yr/yr pct index change	 +2.0	 +0.5	  -3.8</p>
<p> Index (100 = May 1993)	 98.9	 98.1	  96.9</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
